      "message": "nit: Should this be separated into its own test? Seems to be two different use-cases which the code has a distinction for, i.e. system server filing requests on behalf of itself and on behalf of a calling app. Would also make the tests easier to maintain and understand IMO.\n\nAlso, this is also a nit, but you might be able to reuse testRequestCountLimits() with this block of code with some updates to it. Could be a bit convoluted though so up to you.",
