      "writtenOn": "2021-07-30T04:46:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The new version of the test continues to also have the system server-filed requests, so I think it will serve both purposes. In fact, I think we do need to test having both request collections at the same time (which is what this test now does), and if we have this I think there isn\u0027t a lot of value in also testing when only one flavor of callback is registered (I see it as exceedingly unlikely a change would be introduced that would crash if there are many system server requests and no app requests, but not when there are many of both).",
